  "statement": "# Where the Dead Lie — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nExplore a hostile space under pursuit, restore generators and a control puzzle, recover two keys, arm the exit, and escape.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA bounded survival-horror escape with a patrolling monster, ordered restoration and key objectives, readable danger, failure and retry, and a terminal escape state.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the environment layout, puzzle presentation, monster look, key placement, lighting, and feedback while retaining the ordered escape chain.\n"
